# TSConfig suggestions (manual patch list)

## tsconfig.json
- set compilerOptions.allowJs = false
- set compilerOptions.outDir per package/app for TS->dist build clarity
- enable compilerOptions.declaration for publishable packages

## tsconfig.base.json
- set compilerOptions.allowJs = false
- set compilerOptions.outDir per package/app for TS->dist build clarity
- enable compilerOptions.declaration for publishable packages

